{"4167940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stealth Employee", "steam_appid": 4167940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are the workplaces we go to work in every morning with great dedication really that innocent? Stealth Employee tells the story of an ordinary employee who stumbles upon the shady dealings behind the scenes of a logistics company and these secrets. Sadık, an employee at an international company called &quot;Incorporated,&quot; discovers the company's secret activities during an assignment. However, possessing this information will endanger his life. The bosses have taken action to eliminate Sadık. Now, Sadık must survive! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167940/extras/b46c995e6a7f7643aaf48c5cd02a2dc5.avif?t=1783700257\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lose Yourself in the Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth Employee is designed not just to be played, but to be felt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level designs crafted by a single developer will draw you in with their tense atmosphere and intricate detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll feel the tension at every turn as you progress through dark warehouses, quiet office corridors, and the company's secret laboratories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167940/extras/34d15cc0063da64e9be3387f9a0d8c76.avif?t=1783700257\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactics or BOOM BOOM BOOM!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth Employee is designed for stealth, yet offers complete freedom to the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you choose to sneak in and wait for the moment to emerge from the shadows, or break down doors and attack your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of Sadık is yours to decide.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are the workplaces we go to work in every morning with great dedication really that innocent? Stealth Employee tells the story of an ordinary employee who stumbles upon the shady dealings behind the scenes of a logistics company and these secrets. Sadık, an employee at an international company called &quot;Incorporated,&quot; discovers the company's secret activities during an assignment. However, possessing this information will endanger his life. The bosses have taken action to eliminate Sadık. Now, Sadık must survive! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167940/extras/b46c995e6a7f7643aaf48c5cd02a2dc5.avif?t=1783700257\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lose Yourself in the Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth Employee is designed not just to be played, but to be felt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level designs crafted by a single developer will draw you in with their tense atmosphere and intricate detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll feel the tension at every turn as you progress through dark warehouses, quiet office corridors, and the company's secret laboratories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167940/extras/34d15cc0063da64e9be3387f9a0d8c76.avif?t=1783700257\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactics or BOOM BOOM BOOM!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth Employee is designed for stealth, yet offers complete freedom to the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you choose to sneak in and wait for the moment to emerge from the 